Partner logos for the marquee on index.html. 16 of 17 are here; one is missing:

  nordic-hostel.gif   tile class="ag-logo ag-inv": a white or light mark, ideally
                      on transparent, frame 0 only if the source is animated

The other 16 were rebuilt on 28 Oct from the old Squarespace site's originals.
Names and extensions are referenced literally in index.html, and each one
carries a per-logo flag there: class="ag-mul" for logos on a white rectangle,
class="ag-inv" on the tile for white or light logos (orkan, nordic-hostel,
macron). Renaming a file silently breaks its tile.

/assets/* is served with Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable.
To swap a logo, give the new file a different name and update the reference
in index.html.

Delete this file, and the temporary missing-image script in index.html's
<head>, once nordic-hostel.gif is here.
